      <p class="scenario-line"><strong class="label-prot">Protracted path (60%):</strong> MOU holds fragility through Aug&#160;16 (N5 p=0.55) but N2 fails to produce a comprehensive deal (p=0.82 against), locking the region in the interim Islamabad framework with recurring partial violations.</p>
      <p class="scenario-line"><strong class="label-desc">De-escalation path (18%):</strong> N2 closes a comprehensive deal before Aug&#160;17 (p=0.18) AND N5 holds, unlocking full Hormuz transit recovery and a durable diplomatic track beyond the MOU window.</p>
